{"ticker":"TT","updated":"2026-10-24T00:22:25Z","profile":{"longName":"Trane Technologies plc","shortName":"Trane Technologies plc","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","country":"Ireland","website":"https://www.tranetechnologies.com","fullTimeEmployees":44000,"marketCap":97888313344,"trailingPE":33.15201,"forwardPE":25.199219,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.407418,"pegRatio":1.58,"targetMeanPrice":529.1226,"targetHighPrice":575.0,"targetLowPrice":422.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.106,"earningsGrowth":0.071,"grossMargins":0.35389,"operatingMargins":0.19251,"profitMargins":0.13278,"totalRevenue":22209900544,"beta":1.157,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":505.87,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":348.06,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.94},"summary":"Trane Technologies plc designs, manufactures, sells, and services of solutions for heating, ventilation, air conditioning, and custom and transport refrigeration. It offers air conditioners, exchangers, and handlers; airside and terminal devices; air sourced heat pumps; chillers; coils and condensers; auxiliary power, cold storage, and condensing units; controls contracting and commissioning, decarbonization programs, and gensets; dehumidifiers; energy and water efficiency programs; energy recovery ventilators and power solutions; energy storage; furnaces; home automation; humidifiers; HVAC performance-monitoring products; and indoor air quality assessments and related products for HVAC and transport solutions. The company also provides asset management, building management, bus air purification, bus and rail HVAC, container refrigeration, control, ductless, geothermal, data center and multi-pipe HVAC, package heating and cooling, rail refrigeration, residential air filtration, self and vehicle powered truck refrigeration, temporary heating and cooling, truck refrigeration, unitary, variable refrigerant flow, and trailer refrigeration systems. In addition, it offers industrial process refrigeration, installation contracting, lighting retrofit, medical grade refrigeration, refrigerant reclamation, renewable energy and storage, residential hybrid heating, telematics, thermostats/","summary_zh":"特靈科技 (Trane Technologies plc) 設計、製造、銷售暖氣、通風、空調以及客製化和運輸冷凍解決方案並提供服務。它提供空調、交換器和處理器；空側和航站設備；空氣源熱泵；冷水機組；線圈和電容器；輔助動力、冷藏和冷凝裝置；控制承包和調試、脫碳計劃和發電機組；除濕機；能源和水效率計劃；能量回收通風機和電源解決方案；暖通空調；該公司還提供資產管理、樓宇管理、客車空氣淨化、客車和鐵路暖通空調、集裝箱製冷、控制、無管、地熱、資料中心和多管暖通空調、成套加熱和冷卻、鐵路製冷、住宅空氣過濾、自驅動和車輛驅動卡車製冷、臨時加熱和冷卻、卡車製冷、單一、可變製冷劑流量和拖車製冷劑流量。此外，它還提供工業製程製冷、安裝承包、照明改造、醫療級製冷、冷媒回收、再生能源和儲存、住宅混合供暖、遠端資訊處理、恆溫器/","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"建築產品和設備","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":425.21,"h":426.89,"l":419.29,"c":419.63,"v":1103600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":420.46,"h":426.54,"l":418.57,"c":426.19,"v":1099200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":425.47,"h":427.97,"l":424.0,"c":424.19,"v":1144400},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":425.99,"h":427.49,"l":422.58,"c":424.5,"v":1093300},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":426.0,"h":426.62,"l":413.78,"c":415.6,"v":1278600},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":410.03,"h":411.63,"l":405.77,"c":410.93,"v":1300300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":411.68,"h":411.68,"l":403.01,"c":408.31,"v":2298600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":408.85,"h":415.56,"l":408.54,"c":413.15,"v":1243700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":414.92,"h":417.97,"l":406.49,"c":413.83,"v":1280500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":414.71,"h":416.25,"l":412.0,"c":414.93,"v":1069000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":413.38,"h":413.5,"l":403.22,"c":409.41,"v":1181600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":414.05,"h":420.26,"l":409.92,"c":417.32,"v":2264000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":417.99,"h":423.65,"l":405.7,"c":414.88,"v":1483600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":410.87,"h":414.62,"l":400.39,"c":400.77,"v":1563700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":400.46,"h":406.6,"l":397.96,"c":402.44,"v":1560900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":403.04,"h":406.03,"l":398.3,"c":399.99,"v":1402700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":400.0,"h":402.85,"l":394.39,"c":398.96,"v":1229300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":401.31,"h":406.06,"l":398.75,"c":402.49,"v":13