ne Technologies to acquire Cancoil","src":"Cooling Post","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPTEpsTUdyUlNjd3FJT0JKUUZpWVA1dVJFQmhIUVllRl9vLTgwMDVsQVlpUkhIY2RtQjAzdDNxTjltVDFvMm5ZMW9RZVludDNXTk1qQXdCaUlNU251ZkY5VUpGZlo2MEpnNm5wZ29zaE11Q3Mzc3Q2VDd4czVOd0xXRnBVYw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"特靈科技收購 Cancoil"},{"title":"Comfort Systems beats estimates but falls on CFO change, no guidance","src":"Yahoo Finance Singapore","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOQ001UHR4QU5rZlhHQ09hdkp3YzE1TVJ0dThEM05ndFVfay1YRDdQdmZXeWNDNnZuSVQ4X3Zfd25tcGdXcVNkUnBlQnhMWjNleThuOFpZZFdfT0Y0YnpFWjg3V1FYSl9zUTRBQU5KVTdqc1J2dm9ia1g4UmZMb2NrdkhVNnVUakp2ZS1fTW9VMA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Comfort Systems 超出預期，但因 CFO 變更而下降，無指引"},{"title":"Wabtec (WAB) Q3 Earnings Power Margin Gains Above Premium P E","src":"Yahoo Finance Singapore","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPSkRycTVsNlhESWpGNnl5QkJzSlNXZGlyZnE5UjNlOF8wZ0F6aWVOU1FPT0lWX1BWMVZ0ZGYxcVdaRlhPWnFaUGRMczd3akswczc0VnFpdFlxVEtDSWstSWE2bFRQTUJ4c1hRN1BvNlRwc3NueEo5UTdJYnR6c294VVdidw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"Wabtec (WAB) 第三季獲利能力利潤率增幅高於溢價市盈率"}],"themes":[{"name":"能源/電力","count":3},{"name":"併購","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-05","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1466258/000162828026005731/tt-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Trane Technologies plc, a public limited company, incorporated in Ireland in 2009, and its consolidated subsidiaries (collectively we, us, our, the Company) is a global climate innovator. We bring sustainable and efficient solutions to buildings, homes and transportation through our strategic brands, Trane and Thermo King , and our environmentally responsible portfolio of products, services and connected intelligent controls. We generate revenue and cash primarily through the design, manufacture, sales and service of solutions for Heating, Ventilation and Air Conditioning (HVAC), transport refrigeration, and custom refrigeration solutions. As an industry leader with an extensive global install base, our growth strategy includes expanding recurring revenue through services and rental options. Our unique business operating system, uplifting culture and highly engaged team around the world ","zh":"特靈科技有限公司是一家公共有限公司，於 2009 年在愛爾蘭註冊成立，其合併子公司（統稱為「我們」、「我們的」、「公司」）是全球氣候創新者。我們透過我們的策略品牌特靈 (Trane) 和冷王 (Thermo King) 以及我們的環保產品、服務和互聯智慧控制產品組合，為建築、家庭和交通帶來可持續、高效的解決方案。我們主要透過暖氣、通風和空調 (HVAC)、運輸冷氣和客製化冷氣解決方案的設計、製造、銷售和服務來產生收入和現金。作為擁有廣泛全球安裝基礎的行業領導者，我們的成長策略包括透過服務和租賃選項擴大經常性收入。我們獨特的業務作業系統、令人振奮的文化和遍布全球的高度敬業的團隊"},{"en":"Through our sustainability-focused strategy and purpose to boldly challenge what's possible for a sustainable world, we meet critical needs and growing global demand for innovation that reduces greenhouse gas emissions while enabling more efficient buildings and industry, and reliable delivery of essential temperature-controlled cargo. We have announced certain defined sustainability commitments with a goal of achieving these commitments by 2030 (2030 Sustainability Commitments). Trane Technologies' 2030 Sustainability Commitments include our 'Gigaton Challenge' to reduce customer greenhouse gas emissions by a billion metric tons; 'Leading by Example' through reducing embodied carbon by 40%, and designing products for circularity; and creating 'Opportunity for All' by investing in our people and our communities.","zh":"透過我們以永續發展為重點的策略和目標，大膽挑戰永續發展世界的可能性，我們滿足了關鍵需求和全球不斷增長的創新需求，減少溫室氣體排放，同時實現更有效率的建築和工業，並可靠地交付必要的溫控貨物。我們已經宣布了某些明確的永續發展承諾，目標是到 2030 年實現這些承諾（2030 年永續發展承諾）。特靈科技 2030 年永續發展承諾包括“十億噸挑戰”，旨在減少客戶溫室氣體排放十億噸； “以身作則”，將隱含碳減少 40%，並設計循環產品；透過投資於我們的員工和社區，為所有人創造“機會”。"},{"en":"Our Americas segment innovates for customers in North America and Latin America. The Americas segment encompasses commercial heating, cooling and ventilation systems, building controls and solutions, and energy services and solutions; residential heating and cooling; and transport refrigeration systems and solutions. This segment had 2025 net revenues of $17,168.8 million.","zh":"我們的美洲部門為北美和拉丁美洲的客戶進行創新。美洲業務包括商業供暖、製冷和通風系統、建築控制和解決方案以及能源服務和解決方案；住宅供暖和製冷；和運輸冷卻系統和解決方案。該部門 2025 年淨收入為 171.688 億美元。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our products and services are sold in highly competitive markets throughout the world. Due to the diversity of these products and services and the variety of markets served, we encounter a wide variety of competitors that vary by product line and services. They include well-established regional or specialized competitors, as well as larger U.S. and non-U.S. corporations or divisions of larger companies.","zh":"我們的產品和服務銷往全球競爭激烈的市場。由於這些產品和服務的多樣性以及所服務的市場的多樣性，我們遇到了各種各樣的競爭對手，這些競爭對手的產品線和服務各不相同。它們包括成熟的區域或專業競爭對手，以及較大的美國和非美國公司或較大公司的部門。"},{"en":"The principal methods of competition in these markets relate to price, quality, delivery, service and support, technology and innovation. We are one of the leading manufacturers in the world of HVAC systems and services and transport temperature control products and services.","zh":"這些市場的主要競爭方式涉及價格、品質、交付、服務和支援、技術和創新。我們是 HVAC 系統和服務以及運輸溫度控制產品和服務的全球領先製造商之一。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We have no single external customer that accounted for more than 10% of our consolidated net revenues in 2025, 2024 or 2023. No material part of our business is dependent upon a single customer or a small group of customers; therefore, the loss of any one customer would not have a material adverse effect on our results of operations or cash flows.","zh":"我們沒有任何單一外部客戶占我們 2025 年、2024 年或 2023 年合併淨收入的 10% 以上。我們業務的任何重要部分都不依賴單一客戶或一小群客戶；因此，失去任何一位客戶不會對我們的經營業績或現金流量產生重大不利影響。"},{"en":"We both manufacture and procure many of the components included in our products. For components we manufacture, we are required to source a wide variety of commodities such as steel, copper, and aluminum. These principal commodities are purchased from a large number of independent sources around the world, primarily within the region where the products are manufactured. We believe that available sources of supply will generally be sufficient for the foreseeable future.","zh":"我們生產和採購我們產品中的許多組件。對於我們製造的零件，我們需要採購各種商品，例如鋼、銅和鋁。這些主要商品是從世界各地的大量獨立來源購買的，主要是在產品製造的地區內。我們相信，在可預見的未來，可用的供應來源通常是足夠的。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Our products and services are sold in highly competitive markets throughout the world. Due to the diversity of these products and services and the variety of markets served, we encounter a wide variety of competitors that vary by product line and services. They include well-established regional or specialized competitors, as well as larger U.S. and non-U.S. corporations or divisions of larger companies.","zh":"我們的產品和服務銷往全球競爭激烈的市場。由於這些產品和服務的多樣性以及所服務的市場的多樣性，我們遇到了各種各樣的競爭對手，這些競爭對手的產品線和服務各不相同。它們包括成熟的區域或專業競爭對手，以及較大的美國和非美國公司或較大公司的部門。"},{"en":"The principal methods of competition in these markets relate to price, quality, delivery, service and support, technology and innovation. We are one of the leading manufacturers in the world of HVAC systems and services and transport temperature control products and services.","zh":"這些市場的主要競爭方式涉及價格、品質、交付、服務和支援、技術和創新。我們是 HVAC 系統和服務以及運輸溫度控制產品和服務的全球領先製造商之一。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":13982300000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":7339600000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":21321900000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":17168800000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":2802100000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1351000000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":21321900000}},"peers":["CARR","ALLE","J","IR","AME"]}}